WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Keyboard shortcuts. Open the palette, search a list and switch views without the mouse.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: triage at speed; capture without clicking.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:10.930
Press 1 for the list…

4
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.150
/ jumps to the task search.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.070
2 for the board…

6
00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:14.990
3 for the calendar…

7
00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.060
4 for the Gantt chart.

8
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.330
C (or Ctrl K) opens the command palette.

9
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:20.270
Escape closes it.

10
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:26.270
Pressing 2 does nothing: Board and Gantt exist only on projects; the Inbox has list and calendar. A shortcut typed a character instead: Click outside the text field first, or press Escape.

11
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:30.770
Ctrl K / ⌘K or C for the palette
